#~ msgid ""
#~ "Verifying that a file you downloaded or received is actually the one you "
#~ "were expecting is often overlooked or too time-consuming to do. At the "
#~ "same time, it has become very easy to get your hands on a file that has "
#~ "been tampered with, due to the mass increase of malicious webpages and "
#~ "other actors."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Verificare che un file scaricato o ricevuto sia effettivamente quello che "
